<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus invites tenders for wheat, barley.</title>
<headline>Cyprus invites tenders for wheat, barley.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Tuesday invited tenders for one shipment of 12,000 tonnes of European milling wheat and one 25,000 tonne shipment of barley.</p>
<p>A statement from the grain commission said shipment for the wheat should be between March 13 and 28 1997, and for the barley in February 1997.</p>
<p>The tenders close on Friday January 24.</p>
</text>
